Z||000010||Cheever2||03-02-2001||08:42 AM||||In my senior year of HS (1975), on Halloween, on a dark rural state hiway, me & a friend tossed an egg on a car going the other direction... just as the egg left my hand I realized it was a Highway Patrol car!  In the time it took him to get his windshield clean enough to come after us, we turned into a farmhouse with a 1/4 mile long driveway and cut the lights and waited.  We watched him drive by looking for us, then when he got around the next bend we went the other way.  Whew!<BR>||||reg||6
